title: Saloon Doors
text: The doors swing both ways. Go out through one, come back in through the other, and meet up at the bar.
trick: a fixed splitter halves one red beam; one half goes north through a doppler door and turns green, the other goes round the wall and comes south through the other door and turns blue; the fixed splitter at the bar mixes them to cyan
motif: a wall of conduits with a pair of saloon doors (dopplers) in the middle
ink: 4
expect: depth>=4
